{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-07_beg","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-07","title":"只是从天而降！","storyCode":"6-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"0abd89bd352d85a16175824ecc86da9e9716ea47646e584fd817f47c6d802010","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（前）\n9：00 A.M. 天气/阴\n近卫局大楼天台攻防战14小时之前\n切尔诺伯格分城“14区”废墟上空300米处，“坏家伙”号\n任务目标：与罗德岛救援小队合流，营救侦察小组\n人员配置：\n“坏家伙”号及其飞行员；罗德岛精英干员-煌，及其小队成员\n共一十四人。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aircraft"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经到了，阿米娅她们就在这个位置附近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"把小队放在城外，真的好吗？我们现在只有两个人，你下去你只有一个人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，让他们阻截整合运动的追兵，顺带着清理下场地，比让他们在这打仗要有意义得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"行。地形不太好，我只能送你到这儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少让我给你放条挂索下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，你什么时候见我用过挂索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"又要乱来？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？怎么了？乱来啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"每次和你出任务......你干的那些事儿，我光是坐在驾驶座看着都觉着心惊肉跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知不觉中也快习惯了，可这也改变不了你次次乱来的事实啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这说明我和我的小队，和你是有默契的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哪敢和你有什么默契！上回你们把人家的聚落拆了，蓄水池填了，还顺带着炸掉了矿场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你脑瓜子里装着的那些胡思乱想，请通通留在地面上，别带上我的宝贝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"行行行，知道了知道了，“坏家伙”号，哈？取名时候能不能用点心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你给我下去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人估计发现我们了。煌，就送你到这了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我在废城出口等你们。动作快点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，有联络。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......我听得到！声音别那么大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，罗德岛频道的干员，你好！我是近卫局的，已经在废城出口处和你们的小队汇合了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局不是撤离了吗？现在又是演什么戏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我和另外那个姓陈的可不一样！相信我，我是来帮你们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"请问贵姓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"免贵，叫代号吧，诗怀雅长官好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那不就是姓？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，你来处理下，我不知道怎么对付官员......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......煌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不会啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"回来！别跳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才不是叫我下去吗？交给你了！相信你！（飞吻）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞行员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"飞吻个鬼啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......她还好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，已经没有大碍，只是体温还有点低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"从来......就都很低。我没事了，让我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"霜叶......别急。你现在的体温，和平常比还是低了一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，请帮我拿一下绷带。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"说了，我很好。陨星的伤才更重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"不要紧。怎么说我也是个萨卡兹人，我还是更担心你一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，雪怪小队的动向呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"正，正在向我们的位置靠近！还有五百米左右！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"排障作业还没完成吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还要至少十五分钟！这里倒塌的建筑，结构比较复杂，我们不敢直接进行爆破作业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......陨星，做好战斗准备。我们要再维持一会儿防线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。你们带弩弹储备了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有的，让后勤干员给你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅在不在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是有谁的通讯频道是一直开着的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这可是精英干员专用频道，我是能从我这边直接打开的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"这个声音是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"完了。居然派了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"请问......是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是啊，这是哪个干员，怎么这么激情？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"她真能改善现在的局势吗？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"一个叫煌的，能把身边所有东西全拆掉，还让所有人都流一身汗的干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，是我！最后一个评价不太对啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"别......别插科打诨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，你在哪，我们需要你的支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"在你们头上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"还有两百米左右。就要到了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"射程不够，没法攻击那台机器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"能在空中移动的机器......这也是他们的设备？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"确保他们没法下降。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"在罗德岛的援兵到达前，消灭掉这支罗德岛小队。不能让他们合流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"等下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"———往后站！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"她又跳下来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"她又跳下来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，如果你想，我可以带你一起跳一次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的话，我不要。你的小队呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"留在城外了，一会儿就由他们来接应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"风声很大，把通讯器关了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"各位......我们支援一下煌吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，一会儿无论她说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......都点头就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"掉下来的这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"别因为只有一个人就放松警惕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我感受到热量。她一直在用类似加温的法术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动的各位，你们好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想和感染者为敌。但听说各位伤害了我的罗德岛同僚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"而且还在追击我的队友。现在我要打断各位一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......多嘴多舌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，你好，用冰的小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我想试试用我的温度和你的温度打一次。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["霜星"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["霜叶"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["陨星"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["杰西卡"]}]}
